{"id":"25cfce22fc4fe680","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/778_Kleene_强三值逻辑_K_3.md","title":"778 Kleene 强三值逻辑 K 3","display":"778_Kleene_强三值逻辑_K_3","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"778-Kleene-强三值逻辑-K_3\">778 Kleene 强三值逻辑 K_3</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}_{K3s}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prop}_{K3s}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其型别为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{K3s}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{K3s}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,\\bot,\\neg A,A\\wedge B,A\\vee B\">\\(p,\\bot,\\neg A,A\\wedge B,A\\vee B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\\)</span> 为满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{K3s}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{K3s}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\">\\(\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\">\\(\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\">\\(\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变元、替换与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{K3s})\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{K3s})\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{K3s}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{K3s}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Subst}_{K3s}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{K3s}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\\}\\)</span>，并令替换扩张算子</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ext}_{K3s}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{K3s}\\to\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}^{\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ext}_{K3s}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{K3s}\\to\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}^{\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>把每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 送到唯一满足下列递归等式的映射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma:=\\operatorname{Ext}_{K3s}(\\sigma)\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma:=\\operatorname{Ext}_{K3s}(\\sigma)\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{neg}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{neg}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\operatorname{and}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\operatorname{and}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\operatorname{or}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\operatorname{or}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子；相应函数与关系的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{K3s}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{K3s}),\n\\qquad\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,K3s}\\ \\subseteq\\ \\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{K3s}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{K3s}),\n\\qquad\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,K3s}\\ \\subseteq\\ \\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{K3s}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,K3s}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{K3s}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,K3s}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-强-Kleene-三值矩阵\">4. 强 Kleene 三值矩阵</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf V_{K3s}=\\{0,\\tfrac12,1\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf D_{K3s}=\\{1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf V_{K3s}=\\{0,\\tfrac12,1\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf D_{K3s}=\\{1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>底常元解释为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_{K3s}=0\">\\(\\bot_{K3s}=0\\)</span>。语义运算的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg_{K3s}:\\mathsf V_{K3s}\\to\\mathsf V_{K3s},\n\\qquad\n\\wedge_{K3s},\\vee_{K3s}:\\mathsf V_{K3s}^2\\to\\mathsf V_{K3s}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg_{K3s}:\\mathsf V_{K3s}\\to\\mathsf V_{K3s},\n\\qquad\n\\wedge_{K3s},\\vee_{K3s}:\\mathsf V_{K3s}^2\\to\\mathsf V_{K3s}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>逐点定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg_{K3s}0=1,\\qquad\n\\neg_{K3s}\\tfrac12=\\tfrac12,\\qquad\n\\neg_{K3s}1=0,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg_{K3s}0=1,\\qquad\n\\neg_{K3s}\\tfrac12=\\tfrac12,\\qquad\n\\neg_{K3s}1=0,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\wedge_{K3s}b=\\min(a,b),\n\\qquad\na\\vee_{K3s}b=\\max(a,b).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\wedge_{K3s}b=\\min(a,b),\n\\qquad\na\\vee_{K3s}b=\\max(a,b).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-赋值、公式值与反例证书\">5. 赋值、公式值与反例证书</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Val}_{K3s}=\\{v:\\mathsf{Prop}_{K3s}\\to\\mathsf V_{K3s}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Val}_{K3s}=\\{v:\\mathsf{Prop}_{K3s}\\to\\mathsf V_{K3s}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 的扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline v:\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\\to\\mathsf V_{K3s}\">\\(\\overline v:\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\\to\\mathsf V_{K3s}\\)</span> 定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=v(p),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{bot})=\\bot_{K3s},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=v(p),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{bot})=\\bot_{K3s},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\neg_{K3s}\\overline v(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\neg_{K3s}\\overline v(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\wedge_{K3s}\\overline v(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\wedge_{K3s}\\overline v(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\vee_{K3s}\\overline v(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\vee_{K3s}\\overline v(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>反例证书函数的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fail}_{K3s}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Val}_{K3s}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Fail}_{K3s}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Val}_{K3s}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fail}_{K3s}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\{v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{K3s}:\n(\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\overline v(G)\\in\\mathsf D_{K3s})\n\\text{ 且 }\n\\overline v(A)\\notin\\mathsf D_{K3s}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Fail}_{K3s}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\{v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{K3s}:\n(\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\overline v(G)\\in\\mathsf D_{K3s})\n\\text{ 且 }\n\\overline v(A)\\notin\\mathsf D_{K3s}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-语义后承\">6. 语义后承</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\Vdash_{K3s}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{K3s}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\Vdash_{K3s}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{K3s}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Valid}_{K3s}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}:\\varnothing\\Vdash_{K3s}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Valid}_{K3s}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}:\\varnothing\\Vdash_{K3s}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SubRule}_{K3s}\n=\n\\{((A),\\widehat\\sigma(A)):A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s},\\ \\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{K3s}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SubRule}_{K3s}\n=\n\\{((A),\\widehat\\sigma(A)):A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s},\\ \\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{K3s}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-语义证书与证明对象排除\">7. 语义证书与证明对象排除</h1>\n<p>语义证书函数的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SemCert}_{K3s}:\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\n\\longrightarrow\\mathcal P(\\{\\star\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SemCert}_{K3s}:\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\n\\longrightarrow\\mathcal P(\\{\\star\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\\)</span>，定义可核验证书对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SemCert}_{K3s}(\\Gamma,A)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\star\\},&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{K3s}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{K3s}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SemCert}_{K3s}(\\Gamma,A)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\star\\},&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{K3s}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{K3s}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\Vdash_{K3s}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{K3s}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\Vdash_{K3s}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{K3s}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显式性约束：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Valid}_{K3s}\">\\(\\mathsf{Valid}_{K3s}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{K3s}\">\\(\\Vdash_{K3s}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SemCert}_{K3s}\">\\(\\mathsf{SemCert}_{K3s}\\)</span> 均由本文件的真值集合、指定值集合、赋值扩张和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fail}_{K3s}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fail}_{K3s}\\)</span> 定义；不引用外部代数类、公式类或命名基逻辑。</p>\n<p>形式证明规则关系的类型及取值声明为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{K3s}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{K3s}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{K3s}=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{K3s}=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本条目是强 Kleene 三值矩阵语义后承系统；因此不定义非空 Hilbert 公理集合、证明序列或由规则生成的可证关系。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-整个语义形式系统\">8. 整个语义形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{K3s}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{K3s},\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s},\\operatorname{BV}_{K3s},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{K3s},\\operatorname{Ext}_{K3s},\\equiv_{\\alpha,K3s},\n\\mathsf V_{K3s},\\mathsf D_{K3s},\\bot_{K3s},\n\\neg_{K3s},\\wedge_{K3s},\\vee_{K3s},\n\\mathsf{Val}_{K3s},\\overline{(\\cdot)},\\mathsf{Fail}_{K3s},\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{K3s},\n\\Vdash_{K3s},\\mathsf{Valid}_{K3s},\\mathsf{SubRule}_{K3s},\n\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{K3s}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{K3s}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{K3s},\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s},\\operatorname{BV}_{K3s},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{K3s},\\operatorname{Ext}_{K3s},\\equiv_{\\alpha,K3s},\n\\mathsf V_{K3s},\\mathsf D_{K3s},\\bot_{K3s},\n\\neg_{K3s},\\wedge_{K3s},\\vee_{K3s},\n\\mathsf{Val}_{K3s},\\overline{(\\cdot)},\\mathsf{Fail}_{K3s},\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{K3s},\n\\Vdash_{K3s},\\mathsf{Valid}_{K3s},\\mathsf{SubRule}_{K3s},\n\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{K3s}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统的目标差异是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tfrac12\">\\(\\tfrac12\\)</span> 在合取与析取中按链序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min/\\max\">\\(\\min/\\max\\)</span> 传播；该条目只定义语义后承、反例证书和代换保持关系，不含弱 Kleene 的感染式二元运算。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"778-Kleene-强三值逻辑-K_3","text":"778 Kleene 强三值逻辑 K_3","level":1},{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价","text":"3. 自由变元、替换与 $\\alpha$-等价","level":1},{"id":"4.-强-Kleene-三值矩阵","text":"4. 强 Kleene 三值矩阵","level":1},{"id":"5.-赋值、公式值与反例证书","text":"5. 赋值、公式值与反例证书","level":1},{"id":"6.-语义后承","text":"6. 语义后承","level":1},{"id":"7.-语义证书与证明对象排除","text":"7. 语义证书与证明对象排除","level":1},{"id":"8.-整个语义形式系统","text":"8. 整个语义形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}_{K3s}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{K3s}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}.","display":true},{"tex":"p,\\bot,\\neg A,A\\wedge B,A\\vee B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{K3s}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{K3s})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s}(A),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s}(B),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s}(B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Subst}_{K3s}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{K3s}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ext}_{K3s}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{K3s}\\to\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}^{\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}}","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat\\sigma:=\\operatorname{Ext}_{K3s}(\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},","display":true},{"tex":"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{neg}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),","display":true},{"tex":"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\operatorname{and}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),","display":true},{"tex":"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\operatorname{or}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BV}_{K3s}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{K3s}),\n\\qquad\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,K3s}\\ \\subseteq\\ \\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BV}_{K3s}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,K3s}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf V_{K3s}=\\{0,\\tfrac12,1\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf D_{K3s}=\\{1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\bot_{K3s}=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg_{K3s}:\\mathsf V_{K3s}\\to\\mathsf V_{K3s},\n\\qquad\n\\wedge_{K3s},\\vee_{K3s}:\\mathsf V_{K3s}^2\\to\\mathsf V_{K3s}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg_{K3s}0=1,\\qquad\n\\neg_{K3s}\\tfrac12=\\tfrac12,\\qquad\n\\neg_{K3s}1=0,","display":true},{"tex":"a\\wedge_{K3s}b=\\min(a,b),\n\\qquad\na\\vee_{K3s}b=\\max(a,b).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Val}_{K3s}=\\{v:\\mathsf{Prop}_{K3s}\\to\\mathsf V_{K3s}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline v:\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\\to\\mathsf V_{K3s}","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline v(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=v(p),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{bot})=\\bot_{K3s},","display":true},{"tex":"\\overline v(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\neg_{K3s}\\overline v(A),","display":true},{"tex":"\\overline v(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\wedge_{K3s}\\overline v(B),","display":true},{"tex":"\\overline v(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\vee_{K3s}\\overline v(B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fail}_{K3s}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Val}_{K3s}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fail}_{K3s}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\{v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{K3s}:\n(\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\overline v(G)\\in\\mathsf D_{K3s})\n\\text{ 且 }\n\\overline v(A)\\notin\\mathsf D_{K3s}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\Vdash_{K3s}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{K3s}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Valid}_{K3s}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}:\\varnothing\\Vdash_{K3s}A\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{SubRule}_{K3s}\n=\n\\{((A),\\widehat\\sigma(A)):A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s},\\ \\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{K3s}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{SemCert}_{K3s}:\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}\n\\longrightarrow\\mathcal P(\\{\\star\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{SemCert}_{K3s}(\\Gamma,A)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\star\\},&\\mathsf{Fail}_{K3s}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\varnothing,&\\mathsf{Fail}_{K3s}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\Vdash_{K3s}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{K3s}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Valid}_{K3s}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Vdash_{K3s}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{SemCert}_{K3s}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fail}_{K3s}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{K3s}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{K3s}=\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal S_{K3s}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{K3s},\\mathsf{Fm}_{K3s},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{K3s},\\operatorname{BV}_{K3s},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{K3s},\\operatorname{Ext}_{K3s},\\equiv_{\\alpha,K3s},\n\\mathsf V_{K3s},\\mathsf D_{K3s},\\bot_{K3s},\n\\neg_{K3s},\\wedge_{K3s},\\vee_{K3s},\n\\mathsf{Val}_{K3s},\\overline{(\\cdot)},\\mathsf{Fail}_{K3s},\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{K3s},\n\\Vdash_{K3s},\\mathsf{Valid}_{K3s},\\mathsf{SubRule}_{K3s},\n\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{K3s}\n\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\tfrac12","display":false},{"tex":"\\min/\\max","display":false}],"bytes":6235